#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.store.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.store"
msgstr "cuda.tile.store"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:1 of
msgid "Stores a `tile` value into the `array` at the `index` of its |tile space|."
msgstr "将 ``tile`` 值存储到数组 |tile space| 的指定索引位置。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:3 of
msgid ""
"The |tile space| is the result of partitioning the `array` into a grid of"
" tiles with equal size defined by the shape of the `tile`."
msgstr "|tile space| 是将 ``array`` 按 ``tile`` 的形状划分为等大 Tile 网格后得到的结果。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:6 of
msgid ""
"For example, given a tile `t` of shape ``(tm, tn)`` and array of shape "
"``(M, N)``::"
msgstr "例如，给定形状为 ``(tm, tn)`` 的 Tile ``t`` 以及形状为 ``(M, N)`` 的数组： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:11 of
msgid "The above call to `store` will store elements according to::"
msgstr "上述 ``store`` 调用将按如下方式存储元素： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:15 of
msgid ""
"For a tile that partially extends beyond the array boundaries, out-of-"
"bound elements are ignored. If the tile lies entirely outside the array, "
"the behavior is undefined."
msgstr "对于部分超出数组边界的 Tile，越界元素将被忽略。若 Tile 完全位于数组边界之外，则行为未定义。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.store.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:19 of
msgid "The |array| to store to."
msgstr "要写入数据的 |array| 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:21 of
msgid ""
"An index in the |tile space| of ``array``. ``shape`` is inferred from the"
" ``tile`` argument."
msgstr "``array`` 的 |tile space| 中的索引。 ``shape`` 根据 ``tile`` 参数自动推断。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:24 of
msgid ""
"The |tile| to store. The rank of the tile must match rank of the array, "
"unless it is a scalar or 0d tile."
msgstr "要存储的 |tile| 。Tile 的秩（rank）必须与数组的秩匹配，除非它是标量或零维（0-d）Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:27 of
msgid "Order of axis mapping. See :py:func:`load`."
msgstr "轴映射顺序。参见 :py:func:`load` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:29 of
msgid ""
"Whether to bounds-check the tile against the array boundaries. When "
"``False``, the tile is assumed to stay fully within bounds and the out-"
"of-bounds check is skipped, producing a faster store; violating this "
"assumption is undefined behavior. Defaults to ``True``. Setting it to "
"``False`` requires tileiras 13.4+."
msgstr ""
"是否针对数组边界对 Tile 执行边界检查。设为 ``False`` 时，将假定 Tile "
"完全位于边界之内并跳过越界检查，从而提升存储性能；违反该假设将导致未定义行为。默认为 ``True`` 。将其设为 ``False`` 需要 "
"tileiras 13.4+。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:34 of
msgid ""
"A hint indicating how heavy DRAM traffic will be. It shall be an integer "
"between 1 (low) and 10 (high). By default, the compiler will infer the "
"latency."
msgstr "指示 DRAM 访存负载强度的提示值，应为 1（低）到 10（高）之间的整数。默认由编译器自动推断。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:37 of
msgid "If False, the store will not use TMA. By default, TMA is allowed."
msgstr "若为 False，该存储操作不会使用 TMA。默认允许使用 TMA。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:40 of
msgid ""
"Memory ordering semantics for the store. Defaults to "
"``MemoryOrder.WEAK``. Valid values: ``WEAK``, ``RELAXED``, ``RELEASE``."
msgstr ""
"存储操作的内存序语义。默认为 ``MemoryOrder.WEAK`` 。有效值： ``WEAK`` 、 ``RELAXED`` 、 "
"``RELEASE`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:43 of
msgid ""
"The scope of threads that participate in memory ordering. Only meaningful"
" when ``memory_order`` is not ``WEAK``."
msgstr "参与内存排序的线程作用域。仅当 ``memory_order`` 不为 ``WEAK`` 时生效。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:48 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:49 of
msgid "Store into 1D array, partial out of bound store is ignored."
msgstr "存储到一维数组，部分越界的写入将被忽略。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:67 cuda.tile._stub.store:87 of
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store:68 of
msgid ""
"When storing with a scalar (0d tile), it is broadcasted to the rank of "
"the array."
msgstr "使用标量（零维 Tile）进行存储时，会将其广播至与数组相同的秩。"

